@startuml "Stratégie d'invalidation du cache"

title Stratégie d'invalidation du cache

participant "Business Services" as Services
participant "Cache Layer\n(Redis)" as Cache
participant "Frontend\n(Next.js)" as Frontend

Services -> Services: Data modified
Services -> Cache: DEL specific_key
Services -> Cache: PUBLISH cache_invalidation {pattern}

Frontend -> Cache: SUBSCRIBE cache_invalidation
Cache --> Frontend: Invalidation message
Frontend -> Frontend: Clear client-side cache

@enduml